    {
      "source": "Transform the extracted the body with a function, for example, extracting a\nproperty, and assert the mapped value with a <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/util/function/Consumer.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.util.function\"><code>Consumer</code></a>.",
